    "title": "con_26270 - Supplier Audit",
    "description": "The DfE has a framework agreement for restructuring services, \r\nforensic accounting and investigation support and audit and assurance \r\nservices for use by DfE in relation to Education Providers (con_7890).\r\n\r\nThe DfE have awarded a Call-Off Contract to KPMG without re-opening competition, using the rotational process set out in the framework agreement.\r\n\r\nThe contract is for the following services:\r\n1) Investigation of data following allegations of suspected fraud\r\n2) Capture, recovery and storage of electronic data\r\n3) Reporting findings and conclusions",
